---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout'
---

<BaseLayout title='About Me'>
	<section class='max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-gray-800'>
		<h1 class='text-4xl font-bold mb-6'>About Me</h1>
		<img
			src='src/assets/images/avatar.JPG'
			alt='Mariia Glushenkova'
			width='180'
			class='rounded-full mb-3'
		/>

		<p class='text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4'>
			Hi! I'm <strong>Mariia Glushenkova</strong>, a curious and driven software developer based in
			Finland. I specialize in building thoughtful, functional apps and games that bring together
			technology, design, and storytelling.
		</p>

		<p class='text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4'>
			My current focus lies in projects that span urban planning, civic safety, and creative
			software development using technologies like Python, Swift, and React. I also contribute to
			open-source projects and enjoy writing about my learning journey.
		</p>

		<p class='text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4'>
			Beyond development, I’m passionate about photography, running, and exploring different
			cultures. I find energy in meaningful work and believe that technology can be a tool for
			social impact.
		</p>

		<p class='text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4'>
			My recent book, <em>An Exchange of Worlds</em>, captures my experience as an exchange student
			in Austria. It blends personal stories, cultural reflections, and academic insights — part
			diary, part travelogue, part reflection on growth.
		</p>

		<h2 class='text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-2'>🔧 Skills</h2>
		<ul class='list-disc list-inside text-lg space-y-1'>
			<li>Languages: TypeScript, Kotlin, Python, Swift</li>
			<li>Frameworks: React, Tailwind CSS, FastAPI, Godot</li>
			<li>Tools: Git, Firebase, Azure Cloud Services, Figma</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 class='text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-2'>Find Me Online</h2>
		<ul class='list-inside text-lg space-y-1'>
			<li>
				GitHub: <a
					class='text-blue-600 underline'
					href='https://github.com/maguitaria/astroworld-blog'
					target='_blank'>maguitaria</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				LinkedIn: <a
					class='text-blue-600 underline'
					href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/mariia-glushenkova-497208197'
					target='_blank'>Mariia Glushenkova</a
				>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
